[
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00225",
    "bgm": "0000"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "『Ａ』を殺したのは私です",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "99999",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 300,
    "se": "0988",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1600
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00277",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032230010,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～\r\n何それ～",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103223/4901032230010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "いえ、本当のことです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032230020,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……え",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103223/4901032230020"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032230030,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "じゃー、さっき言ってたのは？\r\n狡猾で、残酷で、手段を選ばない……って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103223/4901032230030"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032230040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そい、自分のことやったと？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103223/4901032230040"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032230050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "話のようわからん……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103223/4901032230050"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00682",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "えっと、そもそも……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "私がもっとしっかりしていれば、\r\n『Ａ』が死ぬことはなかったんです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "ですから……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032230060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そ、そういう感じ……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103223/4901032230060"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032230070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "遮ってごめんだけど、\r\n実は何もわかってなかったってことだよね？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103223/4901032230070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "いえ……冷静に考えてみてください\r\n私はこの館の住人で、鍵を持っているんですよ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "みなさんにとって、私は第一の容疑者では？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00684",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032230080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あの……アリバイと足跡は\r\nどう考えたらいいのでしょうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103223/4901032230080"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032230090,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そ、そうですよ……！\r\nさっき、みんなで足跡、確かめて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103223/4901032230090"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032230100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それらを考えれば、お弟子さんは犯人ではない\r\nということになると思うのですが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103223/4901032230100"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032230110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103223/4901032230110"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032230120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "これは、私たちでもう一度考えてみる必要があるかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103223/4901032230120"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032230130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……ねぇ霧子\r\nまずはキミの医学の知識を借りたいのだけれど──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103223/4901032230130"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032230140,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "うん……\r\nあのね──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103223/4901032230140"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "fg": "001923",
    "fgEffect": "fade",
    "fgEffectTime": 1000,
    "bgm": "057b",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "（こうして、\r\n探偵たちによる推理が始まった）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "（俺は、『Ａ』に殉じることも\r\n犯人を逃がすこともできず、蚊帳の外に──）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "（…………）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "（人生にもし、はない\r\nでももし、やり直せるなら、その時は…………）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
